sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Person
  participant C as /sign-in/confirm
  participant H as Route handler
  participant BA as Better Auth
  participant D as Postgres

  U->>C: opens the link from the email
  Note over U,C: the fragment (token, next) stays in the browser:<br/>no server, log or Referer sees it
  C->>C: read the fragment, clear it with history.replaceState
  C-->>U: "Continue" (never auto-submits)
  U->>C: clicks Continue
  C->>H: fetch GET /magic-link/verify?token=…<br/>Sec-Fetch-Site same-origin, Mode cors
  H->>BA: rebuilt request
  BA->>D: spend the token, create the session
  BA->>D: delete every other pending link and code for the address
  BA-->>H: Set-Cookie session and device cookie
  H-->>C: { ok: true } with the cookies
  C-->>U: navigate to next
